<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <meta name="description" content="Learn more about Courier Co, our values, our delivery services, and how we support individuals and businesses.">
    <title>Courier Co | About Us</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/styles.css">
    <link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="/images/favicon-16x16.png">
</head>
<body>
    <header class="navbar">
        <div class="site-title">
            <a href="/">Courier Co</a>
        </div>

        <input type="checkbox" id="menu-checkbox" hidden>
        <label for="menu-checkbox" class="menu-toggle" aria-label="Open menu">☰</label>

        <nav aria-label="Main navigation">
            <ul class="nav-links">
                <li><a href="/">Home</a></li>
                <li><a href="/about">About Us</a></li>
                <li><a href="/services">Services</a></li>
                <li><a href="/enquiries">Enquiries &amp; Contact</a></li>
            </ul>
        </nav>
    </header>

    <main class="about-page">
        <section class="about-intro">
            <p class="eyebrow">Reliable service built on experience</p>
            <h1>About Courier Co</h1>
            <p>
                With over 20 years of experience in the transport industry, Courier Co is focused on
                providing dependable delivery solutions that are efficient, professional, and tailored
                to customer needs.
            </p>
        </section>

        <section class="about-highlights">
            <article class="highlight-card">
                <h2>20+ Years</h2>
                <p>Industry experience supporting delivery and transport needs.</p>
            </article>

            <article class="highlight-card">
                <h2>Flexible Services</h2>
                <p>Same-day, scheduled, and business courier support.</p>
            </article>

            <article class="highlight-card">
                <h2>Customer Focused</h2>
                <p>Built around clear communication and dependable service.</p>
            </article>
        </section>

        <section class="about-content">
            <div class="about-block">
                <h2>Who We Are</h2>
                <p>
                    We are a customer-focused courier business offering dependable local delivery solutions
                    for both individuals and businesses. Our goal is to make collections and deliveries feel
                    straightforward, secure, and efficient from start to finish.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="about-block">
                <h2>What We Offer</h2>
                <p>
                    From urgent same-day deliveries to scheduled collections and ongoing business courier support,
                    we provide practical services designed to suit a wide range of delivery requirements.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="about-block">
                <h2>Our Approach</h2>
                <p>
                    We believe a courier service should be reliable, responsive, and easy to use. That is why
                    we focus on clear communication, flexible service options, and a straightforward customer journey.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="about-block">
                <h2>Why Choose Us</h2>
                <p>
                    Courier Co values professionalism, punctuality, and trust. We aim to deliver parcels safely,
                    on time, and with a level of service that customers feel confident returning to.
                </p>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="about-cta">
            <h2>Need a courier service you can rely on?</h2>
            <p>
                Explore our services or send an enquiry to request a quote tailored to your delivery needs.
            </p>
            <div class="hero-actions">
                <a href="/services" class="btn">View Services</a>
                <a href="/enquiries" class="btn btn-secondary">Send an Enquiry</a>
            </div>
        </section>
    </main>

    <footer class="site-footer">
        <div class="footer-left">
            <a href="https://www.facebook.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Facebook</a>
            <a href="https://www.instagram.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Instagram</a>
            <a href="https://twitter.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">X</a>
        </div>

        <div class="footer-center">
            <p>&copy; 2026 Courier Co</p>
        </div>

        <div class="footer-right">
            <img src="/images/courier-co.jpg" alt="Courier Co logo" class="footer-logo">
        </div>

        <div class="footer-credits">
            <p>
                Images courtesy of
                <a href="https://unsplash.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Unsplash</a>
                and
                <a href="https://www.freepik.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Freepik</a>.
                Favicon from
                <a href="https://favicon.io/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">favicon.io</a>.
            </p>
        </div>
    </footer>
</body>
</html>